Depends: runit
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: PSI-driven ZRAM and memory-pressure policy daemon
 detritusd manages ZRAM pressure using Linux PSI and process-madvise.
 It ships and enables a runit service for Devuan Excalibur.
